1
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,320
Did I not warn you before

2
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,800
If you hurt her again

3
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,480
I'll make you disappear

4
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,000
Seventh Prince

5
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,720
I did it all for you

6
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,880
Once Li Zhi'an reveals the location of the Dragon Jade treasure

7
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,720
Your ascension to the throne will be within reach

8
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,160
Who gave you permission to speculate about my intentions

9
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:58,000
You only need to follow orders

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,080
If the Seventh Prince truly blames me

11
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,400
Then just kill me

12
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,920
After all, I've already shed heart's blood for you

13
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,920
One more wound won't matter

14
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,960
Whatever you give me

15
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,800
I'll gladly accept

16
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,440
Keep a close eye on Zhu Huaichen

17
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,480
That's your real mission

18
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:54,280
Zhu Huaijin, why are you rebelling against Zhu Huaichen

19
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,240
For you

20
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:56,320
For me

21
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,880
I vow to protect you for all eternity

22
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,520
No more getting hurt

23
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,720
This is what I owe you

24
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:06,600
Lee Ji-an, snap out of it

25
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,320
You can't fall into this

26
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,480
That Zhu guy is as bad as his gang

27
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:11,640
None of them can be trusted

28
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,800
Maybe she's after the dragon jade on my back

29
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,560
Stop dwelling on it

30
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:36,720
Her behavior was so unusual

31
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,600
Could she really see it?

32
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,120
Did she know about the gu worm in the cup?

33
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,280
Impossible, I tested her

34
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,280
She didn't even avoid the boiling oil

35
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,720
There's no way she could see

36
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:47,920
Then you really should stop thinking about it

37
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,240
That kiss was meant for Zhu Huaichen

38
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,200
Not for you

39
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,160
Zhu Huaichen doesn't deserve it

40
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,000
Neither do I

41
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,120
Lee Ji-an

42
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:02,480
If you win, I'll make you pay the price

43
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:09,560
We need to turn Li Zhi'an into a blind man that no one wants

44
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,560
This will require your hard work

45
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,600
But rest assured

46
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,600
After we put the mask on you

47
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,480
You won't disgrace our Nanliang royal family

48
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,280
Let's go

49
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,960
My seventh brother is truly loyal to me

50
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:34,120
He personally lured the snake

51
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,960
This snake-luring is crucial for His Highness to punish Li Zhi'an

52
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,520
And obtain the Dragon Jade treasure

53
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:43,000
I will personally oversee this matter

54
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,480
Zhu Huaichen

55
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,080
This time I must protect Zhi'an

56
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,360
I absolutely won't let you succeed

57
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,920
This might be our last meeting in this lifetime

58
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,920
Zhi'an

59
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,240
You must live well from now on

60
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:28,120
Sir, why are you covered in wounds?

61
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,360
In these mountain wilds

62
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,120
Did you encounter wild beasts?

63
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,160
Do you need help?

64
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,520
No need, I'm waiting for someone

65
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,560
Miss

66
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,080
The weather is about to change

67
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,720
You should head down the mountain quickly

68
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,640
Why?

69
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,600
Why couldn't I change anything?

70
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,440
Why is it still like this?

71
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:17,360
Why are you so kind-hearted

72
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,120
To turn back

73
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,800
You wouldn't understand

74
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,320
This is what I owe her
